      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.69,
          "end": 3.03,
          "en": "So to finish this section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.03,
          "end": 8.03,
          "en": "and to learn a bit more about data mutations with NextJS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.49,
          "end": 10.83,
          "en": "I wanna make this like button here work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.83,
          "end": 13.32,
          "en": "so that for a given post I can click it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.32,
          "end": 17.283,
          "en": "and well, this post will get marked as liked by me.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.6,
          "end": 20.94,
          "en": "Now for that in the database,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.94,
          "end": 24.72,
          "en": "I actually already got a likes table",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.72,
          "end": 28.35,
          "en": "that is set up when the database file is created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.35,
          "end": 32.56,
          "en": "where I'll in the end store a user ID/post ID combination",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.48,
          "end": 37.89,
          "en": "so that every user can like every post exactly once.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.89,
          "end": 40.59,
          "en": "And of course they can also unlike it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.59,
          "end": 45.18,
          "en": "Now when selecting all posts, I got some query in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45.18,
          "end": 48.99,
          "en": "where in the end I find out whether a post is being liked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 48.99,
          "end": 53.4,
          "en": "by a specific user by checking whether the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 53.4,
          "end": 57.21,
          "en": "with their ID likes a post with a given ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 57.21,
          "end": 61.02,
          "en": "And here I always assume that it's the user with ID two",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 61.02,
          "end": 65.04,
          "en": "because I can't make that user specific at this point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 65.04,
          "end": 67.59,
          "en": "because we got no way of switching users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 67.59,
          "end": 70.08,
          "en": "or logging in with users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 70.08,
          "end": 72.84,
          "en": "That's why in this section we assumed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 72.84,
          "end": 77.84,
          "en": "that posts are always created by a user with ID one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 78.39,
          "end": 82.26,
          "en": "and vice versa, I always assume that it's always the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 82.26,
          "end": 86.07,
          "en": "with the ID two that may be liking a post here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 86.07,
          "end": 89.97,
          "en": "so that it's a different user that's now logged in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 89.97,
          "end": 92.55,
          "en": "that can view the posts and that can like the posts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 92.55,
          "end": 95.25,
          "en": "That's why this is hard coded like this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 95.25,
          "end": 96.96000000000001,
          "en": "as mentioned multiple times.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 96.96000000000001,
          "end": 100.65,
          "en": "Later you will learn how to actually work with users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 100.65,
          "end": 102.9,
          "en": "and how to log in and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 102.9,
          "end": 104.1,
          "en": "But that's the logic here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 104.1,
          "end": 105.99199999999999,
          "en": "And in the end here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.99199999999999,
          "end": 109.56,
          "en": "I then create a new IsLiked property on the retrieved data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 109.56,
          "end": 111.42,
          "en": "that is either true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.42,
          "end": 114.57,
          "en": "In the end, depending on whether a given user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114.57,
          "end": 118.8,
          "en": "has created a like entry in that likes table",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.8,
          "end": 120.99,
          "en": "for a given post.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.99,
          "end": 124.77,
          "en": "And those like entries are created or removed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.77,
          "end": 129.12,
          "en": "with help of this updatePostLikeStatus function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 129.12,
          "end": 132.723,
          "en": "where I find out whether a given user with a given ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.769,
          "end": 136.38,
          "en": "which will be ID two here in this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.38,
          "end": 138.93,
          "en": "is liking a post or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 138.93,
          "end": 141.96,
          "en": "So whether a user has an entry in that likes table or not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.96,
          "end": 144.78,
          "en": "and if they don't have one, I insert one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 144.78,
          "end": 146.79,
          "en": "If they did have one I delete it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.79,
          "end": 148.77,
          "en": "whenever this button is pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.77,
          "end": 150.243,
          "en": "That's the plan.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 151.35,
          "end": 154.44,
          "en": "Now to bring that plan to life,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 154.44,
          "end": 158.31,
          "en": "we of course have to bring that button to life,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 158.31,
          "end": 162.12,
          "en": "and for that we should go to that posts.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 162.12,
          "end": 163.89,
          "en": "in the components folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.89,
          "end": 166.11,
          "en": "where I have a post component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.11,
          "end": 169.44,
          "en": "because it's in there where I'm outputting my post items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.44,
          "end": 171.633,
          "en": "and where I have this like button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.5,
          "end": 174.24,
          "en": "And the goal now is to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.24,
          "end": 176.57999999999998,
          "en": "that whenever the like button is pressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.57999999999998,
          "end": 179.64,
          "en": "we actually trigger some code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.64,
          "end": 184.38,
          "en": "that creates a new post user ID entry in the likes table",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 184.38,
          "end": 185.91,
          "en": "or removes it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 185.91,
          "end": 189.72,
          "en": "with help of this updatePostLikeStatus function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.72,
          "end": 190.923,
          "en": "I just showed you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 191.94,
          "end": 194.49,
          "en": "Now how can we make this work?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 194.49,
          "end": 198.48,
          "en": "Well, we can make it work with help of a new Server Action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 198.48,
          "end": 201.09,
          "en": "because in the end when that button is pressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.09,
          "end": 203.67000000000002,
          "en": "we also wanna submit some data to the Server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 203.67000000000002,
          "end": 205.89,
          "en": "and we wanna update the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 205.89,
          "end": 209.73,
          "en": "So again, it's in the end another form submission",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 209.73,
          "end": 211.74,
          "en": "we're dealing with here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.74,
          "end": 214.92000000000002,
          "en": "Therefore, we could create a Server Action here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 214.92000000000002,
          "end": 217.47,
          "en": "or do it in that separate actions file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 217.47,
          "end": 218.79,
          "en": "which we created earlier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 218.79,
          "end": 221.55,
          "en": "And that's indeed what I'll do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 221.55,
          "end": 225.87,
          "en": "So in that actions folder, in the posts.js file there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 225.87,
          "end": 228.54,
          "en": "I'll export a new async function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 228.54,
          "end": 232.353,
          "en": "called togglePostLike status.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 233.82,
          "end": 236.76,
          "en": "And I expect to get the ID of the post",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 236.76,
          "end": 239.223,
          "en": "for which I wanna change the like status.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 240.48,
          "end": 245.48,
          "en": "And I then wanna call this update post like status function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 247.47,
          "end": 250.293,
          "en": "So this function which will update the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 251.13,
          "end": 254.43,
          "en": "Now this function wants a post ID and a user id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 254.43,
          "end": 255.99,
          "en": "And as I mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 255.99,
          "end": 259.47,
          "en": "here I'll hardcode the user ID to two,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 259.47,
          "end": 262.533,
          "en": "so to that user with the ID two,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 263.91,
          "end": 265.89,
          "en": "but of course the post ID should be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 265.89,
          "end": 268.83299999999997,
          "en": "the post ID we're receiving as a argument here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 270.43,
          "end": 272.03,
          "en": "And that's then essentially all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 273.33,
          "end": 276.21,
          "en": "Back in the post component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 276.21,
          "end": 279.36,
          "en": "I'd therefore now wanna trigger that Server Action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 279.36,
          "end": 282.63,
          "en": "that we just added whenever this like button is pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 282.63,
          "end": 284.48,
          "en": "And there are two ways of doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 285.69,
          "end": 286.68,
          "en": "One way of doing it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 286.68,
          "end": 289.14,
          "en": "would be to go to the actual button element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 289.14,
          "end": 291.45,
          "en": "which is defined in the like button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 291.45,
          "end": 292.71,
          "en": "And it turns out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 292.71,
          "end": 296.1,
          "en": "that there you can indeed set a form action prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 296.1,
          "end": 300.033,
          "en": "which also accepts such a form action as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 300.96,
          "end": 304.14,
          "en": "So we could accept this action as a input here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 304.14,
          "end": 306.183,
          "en": "and bind that to this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 307.05,
          "end": 309.93,
          "en": "And then in the post component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 309.93,
          "end": 314.31,
          "en": "we could pass the action prop to the like button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 314.31,
          "end": 317.37,
          "en": "And the value I wanna pass here should of course be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 317.37,
          "end": 321.843,
          "en": "that togglePostLikeStatus action we just worked on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 323.7,
          "end": 327.24,
          "en": "which therefore is imported from that actions folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 327.24,
          "end": 328.89300000000003,
          "en": "and the posts file there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 330.81,
          "end": 332.82,
          "en": "That would be one way of making it work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 332.82,
          "end": 336,
          "en": "because you can not just use Server Actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 336,
          "end": 339.33,
          "en": "as a value for the action prop on a form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 339.33,
          "end": 343.05,
          "en": "but also instead as a value for the form action prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 343.05,
          "end": 344.574,
          "en": "on a button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 344.574,
          "end": 345.713,
          "en": "That's one way of using them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 346.65,
          "end": 349.05,
          "en": "However, that's not what I'll do here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 349.05,
          "end": 350.823,
          "en": "even though it would work fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 352.44,
          "end": 356.85,
          "en": "Instead I'll simply wrap this like button with a form here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 356.85,
          "end": 359.67,
          "en": "Because there's nothing wrong with doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 359.67,
          "end": 362.1,
          "en": "And I'll then set this action prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 362.1,
          "end": 363.753,
          "en": "directly here on the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 365.01,
          "end": 367.8,
          "en": "So that's in the end, the same approach I used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 367.8,
          "end": 369.933,
          "en": "for the new post page form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 371.13,
          "end": 373.23,
          "en": "With that, whenever this button is pressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 373.23,
          "end": 375.72,
          "en": "it will be this action, this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 375.72,
          "end": 376.89300000000003,
          "en": "that will be triggered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 378.12,
          "end": 382.17,
          "en": "Now theoretically that's all we need to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 382.17,
          "end": 385.53,
          "en": "However, if we save everything and I reload here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 385.53,
          "end": 390.53,
          "en": "and I click this button, it stays in that unliked mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 390.84,
          "end": 393.15,
          "en": "Now to some extent that makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 393.15,
          "end": 395.85,
          "en": "because we haven't added any logic here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 395.85,
          "end": 399.54,
          "en": "anywhere in our markup that would change the appearance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 399.54,
          "end": 402.87,
          "en": "of that button or of that icon in that button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 402.87,
          "end": 405.9,
          "en": "depending on whether the post is liked or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 405.9,
          "end": 407.433,
          "en": "So we should change that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 408.35,
          "end": 410.34000000000003,
          "en": "and we can change that by adding a class here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 410.34000000000003,
          "end": 414.51,
          "en": "a CSS class to that form or to that div, doesn't matter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 414.51,
          "end": 418.59000000000003,
          "en": "but it should be on some parent element of this like button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 418.59000000000003,
